{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"筲箕灣單位火警約300人疏散　75歲男子受傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/FIRE-SKW-261128-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】筲箕灣凌晨有單位起火，約300人需要疏散，一名男子受傷送院。</p><p>警方及消防員到場，協助約三百名居民疏散到地下。凌晨一時許，愛蝶灣4座一個單位起火，消防員接報到場開喉灌救，約20分鐘後將火救熄，一名75歲男子多處輕微燒傷清醒送院。</p><p>消防初步調查後懷疑是電器短路引致火警。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-28T00:04:17.464433+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:20:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T01:57:30.907714+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:57:49.253345+00:00","content_hash":"36341237abd8dbbd7c868e82fb4161518a613fddd7bfa2a7d67f497ec2fb93b4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}